&lt;p&gt;The 2nd annual Madison Queer Liberation March will be happening on June 13, 2026. Starting at 10 AM at &lt;a rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;maps.app.goo.gl&#x2F;QaqV9trde5K3s3nD8&quot;&gt;McPike Park&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;, we will march to the capitol with the following demands to Defend Bodily Autonomy:&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect Trans Youth&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare for All&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Queer Workers&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
